msgid "The fields above are what shoppers reading %s see. Write the same popup here for each of your other languages. Anything you leave empty falls back to the wording above."
msgstr "Die Felder oben sehen Käufer, die %s lesen. Schreiben Sie das gleiche Popup hier für jede Ihrer anderen Sprachen. Alles, was Sie leer lassen, greift auf den Wortlaut oben zurück."

#. translators: %s: the store's default language, e.g. "Eesti".
#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4832
#, php-format
msgid "The popup itself is already written in %s in the fields above. What is left here is the wording the popup writes on its own, which follows your site language. Translate it if your language is not one BrikPanel ships a translation for."
